      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 1,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "As for the collapsed well, \r\nif it could be restored to how it was before, \r\nI'd have no further complaints.",
        "Jp" : "あとは、潰されちゃった井戸が\r\n元通りになれば言うこと無しだよ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 674948,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 2,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "You know, no matter how you look at it, \r\ncooking uses a lot of water.\r\nYou'd notice a big difference\r\nif there was a well inside the dining hall \r\ncompared with the lack of one.",
        "Jp" : "料理ってなんだかんだで水をいっぱい使うでしょ？\r\n食堂の中に井戸があるのと無いのとでは\r\n大違いなんだ"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 674949,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
